# Document licences

Document licences vary by file. The [licence map](LICENSES.md) records the
current split declarations: **Coastline (CC-BY-SA-4.0)** for mapped framework
and navigation documents, **Sail (CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0)** for mapped analyses,
and **CC-BY-4.0** for mapped data. **Handbook (MIT)** covers mapped design
assets; **Model B** means distributed copies pinned by checksum.

The original version of this file declared CC-BY-4.0 for all repository
documents. That declaration remains part of the version history; this
clarification does not revoke rights already granted. Files missing from the
split map require the explicit scope review recorded there, rather than a
licence inferred from a page's visual styling.

